    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "One recent Sunday morning, I planned to read a bit of a novel after breakfast. Just as I opened the book, however, my phone rang. A deliveryman asked if he could put a package in the parcel locker downstairs. I agreed and hung up. Shortly after, my friend Brad messaged me on WeChat. Our quick chat turned into a 40-minute conversation. When we finished, it was already eleven. As I was about to get back to my book, a "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "promotional",
            "zh": "推销的"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " email popped up. Then, the Eleme app chimed in: It’s lunchtime! Click here to get a "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "coupon",
            "zh": "优惠券"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "This experience reminded me of an article I had recently come across about Christopher Nolan. The Oscar-winning director is known for high-tech movies like "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "Inception"
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "",
            "zh": "《盗梦空间》"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " and "
          },
          {
            "t": "em",
            "v": "Interstellar"
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "",
            "zh": "《星际穿越》"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". But in his personal life, the 53-year-old avoids technological "
          },
          {
            "t": "underline",
            "v": "distractions"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". He doesn’t own a smartphone and has never used email. He does write the "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "scripts",
            "ref": "v-script"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " for his movies on a computer, but the device has no internet connection. “I’ve never used email. I don’t think it’s helpful for anything I do,” he said. “And staying off a smartphone gives me time to think.”"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Of course, Nolan can live without a phone or email account because his assistants can take calls and respond to online messages for him. Most of us can’t expect to live a life like that of an "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "influential",
            "ref": "v-influential"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " director. However, that doesn’t mean Nolan’s “no email, no phone” "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "policy",
            "ref": "v-policy"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " doesn’t make any sense. Rather, it shows us the importance of focus in today’s digital world."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The sharp rise in internet "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "usage",
            "ref": "v-usage"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " over the past ten years has come at a cost. That is, we are slowly losing the ability to focus. Our smartphones and other devices can distract us at any second of the day. It has become increasingly difficult to focus on a single task for long periods."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Nolan’s ability to produce so many excellent movies probably has something to do with his ability to focus. Without digital distractions, he can be all in when he works. He can fully focus on the job until it’s done."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Most of us can’t afford to "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "cut the cord",
            "zh": "网线"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " entirely. But when we want to focus on our work, our studies, or just a good book, we might do well to put away our electronic devices for a while."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
